      "problem": "Expand and simplify $(2n - 1)(3n - 6).$",
      "worked_solution": "We take each term of the first binomial and multiply it by the second binomial. Then, we simplify by collecting like terms.\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t(2n - 1)(3n - 6) &= \\\n\t\t2n(3n - 6) + (-1)(3n - 6) &= \\\n\t\t6n^2 - 12n - 3n + 6 &= \\\n\t\t6n^2 - 15n + 6\n\t}\n$$",
